   "id": 648626,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\">\n    <li>The function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span>&nbsp;is defined by <span data-math=\"f(x)=50 \\cdot 3^x\">f(x)=50 \\cdot 3^x</span>. The function <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>&nbsp;is defined by <span data-math=\"g(x)=a\\cdot b^x\"></span>.\n<p> Here are graphs of <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> and <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>.</p> \n\n<img alt=\"Graph of two increasing exponential functions, labeled f and g, xy-plane, origin O.\" src=\"exercises/media/e0387e7c203a15bb.svg\"><br> <br>       <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n        <li>In <span data-math=\"g(x)\">g(x)</span>, is  <span data-math=\"a\">a</span> greater than or less than 50?</li>\n      </ol>\n</li>\n  </ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1279233,
     "content_html": "less than"
    },
    {
     "id": 1279234,
     "content_html": "greater than"
    }
   ],
